<title>UK: Bertelsmann unit sets 200 mln mark five-year bond.</title>
<headline>Bertelsmann unit sets 200 mln mark five-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager Commerzbank.</p>
<p> BORROWER   BERTELSMANN US FINANCE INC</p>
<p> GUARANTOR  BERTELSMANN AG</p>
<p> AMT    200 MLN DEM   COUPON     4.50	MATURITY    19.FEB.02</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  100.94    PAY DATE    19.FEB.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  2.50	SPREAD     +50 BP    PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p> MOODY/S&amp;P  =	   DENOMS (K) 1-10	LISTING     FFT</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    GERMAN    HOME CTRY  GERMANY   TAX PROVS   =</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.25	SELL CONC  1.75	LIST FEE    0.50</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
